      (Becoming.RouteFormation.prepared 27 6 Becoming.RouteFormation.collapsed) Becoming.RouteFormation.repair y →
    y.drawn = 16 ∧ y.stock = 4 ∧ y.usedParts = 6 ∧ y.parts = 0 ∧ 7 + y.drawn + y.stock = 27
@Becoming.RouteFormation.repair_course_no_parts : ∀ {y : Becoming.RouteFormation.Apparatus},
  Generative.Trace Becoming.RouteFormation.formationProcess
